                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>A. \u201cNon-Personal Information\u201d</p><p>Information that does not identify you personally and is collected automatically when you browse the Website or use our Services.</p><p>B. \u201cPersonally Identifiable Information\u201d</p><p>Information that can be used to identify you, such as your name, address, age, phone number, or other details shared while using our Services.</p>",
