            "accordion_row_VKqMR6": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "INFORMATION WE COLLECT",
                "open_by_default": true,
                "keywords": "Information, Registration, Customer Support",
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_Din7MH": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>When you access the Website, AltaRasa may automatically gather Non-Personal Information (e.g., browser type, IP address). We may also collect Personally Identifiable Information through:</p><ul><li>Forms, registrations, or other inputs on the Website.</li><li>Emails, calls, messages, or interactions via social media.</li><li>Data transmitted from your mobile device, if you use one to access our Services.</li><li>Information received from third parties.</li></ul><p><strong>A. Registration</strong></p><p>To create an account, you may be required to share details such as your name, email address, company information, and contact number. We may request additional optional information to improve your experience. By registering on the AltaRasa Website, you allow us to identify you and use your information in accordance with this Policy and our Terms.</p><p><strong>B. Customer Support</strong></p><p>When you communicate with AltaRasa\u2019s support team, we collect information to verify your concerns, respond appropriately, and investigate any issues.</p><p><strong>C. Third-Party Services</strong></p><p>If you access or interact with third-party platforms through our Website, those parties may collect information according to their own policies. AltaRasa may receive information related to such interactions and will use it only as permitted under this Policy.</p><p><strong>D. Cookies</strong></p><p>The Website may use cookies, which are small data files stored on your device. Cookies help us recognize returning users, understand Website usage patterns, and personalise your browsing experience.</p><p>You may disable cookies through your browser settings, but certain features may not function properly.</p><p>We may also allow approved third parties to place cookies for analytics or advertising; these cookies do not contain Personally Identifiable Information.</p><p><strong>E. Web Beacons & Tracking Tools</strong></p><p>AltaRasa may use web beacons, tracking pixels, or similar tools to gather Non-Personal Information for analytics, auditing, advertising performance, and newsletter engagement. These tools do not track your activity outside our Website unless explicitly permitted.</p><p><strong>F. Device & Log Information</strong></p><p>When you browse the Website, we may receive:</p><ul><li>The URL you came from and visit next</li><li>Your IP address</li><li>Browser type and operating system</li><li>Device details (including device identifiers and mobile OS)</li><li>Usage patterns</li><li>Mobile carrier or ISP information</li><li>Location data shared via GPS-enabled services</li></ul><p>This information helps us improve the Website, troubleshoot issues, and secure our systems.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
