            "accordion_row_MwdeGB": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "WHEN WE MAY SHARE YOUR INFORMATION",
                "open_by_default": true,
                "keywords": "",
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_UUMmBi": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>AltaRasa may disclose Personally Identifiable Information only in the following circumstances:</p><p><strong>A. Service Providers</strong></p><p>We may share information with contractors, partners, or service providers who support Website operations, marketing, analytics, customer service, or other business needs.</p><p>Such partners are required to:</p><ol><li>Use your information only for their assigned function</li><li>Protect your information in a manner consistent with this Policy</li></ol><p><strong>B. Legal Obligations & Safety</strong></p><p>We may disclose information if required by:</p><ul><li>Law, regulation, or legal process</li><li>Court order, subpoena, or governmental request</li><li>Protection of AltaRasa\u2019s legal rights or the safety of users</li><li>Prevention of fraud or security threats</li></ul><p>We will attempt to notify you unless legally prohibited.</p><p><strong>C. Opt-Out Options</strong></p><p>If you wish to restrict certain sharing with service providers, you may contact us at the email provided below.</p><p>This opt-out does not apply to situations described in Sections 8.A or 8.B.</p><p><strong>D. Third-Party Hosted Services</strong></p><p>Some AltaRasa content or features may be delivered through third-party websites. We will not share your Personally Identifiable Information with those platforms without your consent. However, any information you submit directly to those sites will be governed by their own policies.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
